Model files (models/, shipped inside liveness-onnx-<version>-models.jar and the Android APK):

- YuNet face detector, OpenCV Zoo (https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu (licenses/MIT-YuNet.txt).
- MediaPipe Face Mesh V2 landmark model, Google, converted by PINTO0309 (PINTO_model_zoo 410_FaceMeshV2),
  Apache License 2.0; weights stored as float16 by this project (models/tools/fp16_weights.py).
- MiniFASNetV2 and MiniFASNetV1SE, Minivision Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing
  (https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing), ONNX export by yakhyo
  (https://github.com/yakhyo/face-anti-spoofing), Apache License 2.0.
- SFace face recognition model, OpenCV Zoo, trained by Yaoyao Zhong, converted by Chengrui Wang,
  Apache License 2.0; weights stored as float16 by this project.
- 30 vertices of the MediaPipe canonical face model (google-ai-edge/mediapipe,
  mediapipe/modules/face_geometry/data/canonical_face_model.obj), Apache License 2.0, embedded in
  liveness/liveness-onnx/src/main/java/io/mosip/liveness/onnx/mesh/CanonicalFace.java.
